# Code-only repository: ignore everything, then let source and docs back in.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.md
!*.json
!*.txt
!*.svg
!*.toml
!assets/*.png

# Generated media, caches and environments (never committed)
voice/
__pycache__/
.venv*/
third_party/

# Raw experiment outputs and data (regenerate with the scripts in research/)
logs/
raw/
results/
arrays/
images/
weights/
ckpt/
data/
out/
preflight/
preflight2/

# The local index (briefs/make_index.py writes it; links to the MP4s): GitHub shows .github/README.md
/README.md
